{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56243","headline":"判导江县申状封皮上着状门府衙 · 宋光嗣","name":"判导江县申状封皮上着状门府衙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勅加开府，不是门府。\n典押双眇，令佐单瞽。\n量提书罚，胜打十五。\n令佐盘庚，典押岁取。\n事了速归，用修廨宇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋光嗣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}